    },
    "seed": [
      {
        "path": "README.md",
        "content": "# {workspace} — research room\n\nEverything the analysts and the agent know about the covered companies lives here as plain files. Every figure the agent reports is cited to a file in this room and a page or slide in it.\n\n## The tree\n\n```\nCompanies/{company_id}/             one folder per covered company\n  context.md                        what we know about the company, curated by its covering analyst\n  interactions.jsonl                earnings calls and meetings, append-only\n  filings/\n    lodr/                           SEBI LODR filings: {YYYY-MM-DD}_{tag}_{name}; annual report maps and extracts\n    presentations/                  investor presentations, concall transcripts, ip-metrics.jsonl, guidance.jsonl\n    filing-log.jsonl                the dated log of everything filed\n    kpis.jsonl                      the standard quarterly KPI table, one row per KPI, cited\n    annual-report-data.jsonl        line items extracted from annual reports\nPeople/{person_id}/                 management and IR contacts (external people only)\nUploads/                            files analysts attach in chat\n```\n\nTwo rules the room depends on:\n\n1. A company's material never goes outside its own `Companies/{company_id}/` folder.\n2. Nothing is written without its validator passing, and nothing is reported without its source.\n"
      },
      {
        "path": "Customers/README.md",
        "content": "# Companies\n\nOne folder per covered housing finance company, named by its id (the NSE symbol where there is one).\n\n- Listed companies: quarterly results (SEBI LODR Reg 33) and their own investor presentation.\n- Unlisted, debt-listed companies: SEBI LODR filings first (Reg 52), then the parent company's investor presentation.\n- Companies with no listed securities publish no LODR filings; the agent will say so rather than guess.\n\nAsk the agent to \"get the latest filings for <company>\" to start a folder.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
  "agent": {
    "briefing": "This is a financial research workspace for analysts covering Indian housing finance companies. For research requests delegate to the research specialists (`lodr-filings`, `investor-presentations`, `annual-report-format`, `hfc-kpi-extraction`) and relay their `needs_review`, `carried_forward` and `not_found` statuses as they are. Every figure carries its document and page or slide; never state a number from memory. Keep the two tracking areas true as work happens: a company's Portfolio entry (its build-out stage and completeness) and a Coverage report for each report you produce."
  },
